      "content": "wait, \"goblin\" bugs? that's a weird way to put it lol. are you saying these are actually common industry terms for these kinds of glitches? i've seen some people call them gremlins before, but i've never heard \"goblin\" specifically in a professional audit context. \n\nanyway, can u finish the checklist? u mentioned the DOM inspection, what else should i be looking for to catch these erratic focus jumps?",
      "source": "evaluator"
